OL,3,GNEWSAMiner welcomes pension release but
OL,4,Aurges speed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurt Moncur, who worked at Murton
OL,7,FColliery in County Durham, said it was
OL,8,F"the best news" but urged pay-outs were
OL,9,Fmade as quickly as possible as former
OL,10,Fminers were dying every day.
